  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now reads through a local that names the materialized collection. var active = orders.Where(o => o.Active); followed by a loop, an element extraction or a callback over active was silent, because hoisting a view into a variable dropped the proof. A local assigned exactly once from the collection, from a view or copy of it, or from another such alias now stands in for it. Escaping that alias is an escape of the collection, which also removes a false positive 5.7.28 had.",
